1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,187
Hands-On Practice.

2
00:00:02,137 --> 00:00:05,475
Run the practice service and earn your sign-off.

3
00:00:05,475 --> 00:00:07,862
Practice Service Checklist.

4
00:00:07,862 --> 00:00:14,262
Recall the Sunday scene: Start from zero — recall the scene, verify faders moved to saved positions.

5
00:00:14,262 --> 00:00:18,725
Line check two mics and playback: Test a vocal mic and a handheld.

6
00:00:18,725 --> 00:00:21,762
Play walk-in music and verify levels.

7
00:00:21,762 --> 00:00:29,462
Set gain on one mic: All 7 steps: select, solo, perform, adjust, low cut, unsolo, fader near 0.

8
00:00:29,462 --> 00:00:32,725
Walk-in, then a welcome: Music on low.

9
00:00:32,725 --> 00:00:36,787
Unmute speaker mic a beat before they speak, lower music.

10
00:00:36,787 --> 00:00:40,087
Mix one worship song: Bring up the band.

11
00:00:40,087 --> 00:00:42,275
Lead vocal on top.

12
00:00:42,275 --> 00:00:44,900
Practice smooth fader moves.

13
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,800
Two-minute 'sermon': Mute the band.

14
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,462
Keep the pastor mic up and clear.

15
00:00:50,462 --> 00:00:56,062
Adjust a monitor and exit: Enter Sends on Fader, make one change, exit correctly.

16
00:00:56,062 --> 00:00:58,187
Confirm main mix.

17
00:00:58,187 --> 00:01:03,737
Respond to feedback call: Instructor creates feedback — you find and pull the right fader.

18
00:01:03,737 --> 00:01:08,012
Power down in correct order: Speakers first, console last.

19
00:01:08,012 --> 00:01:09,887
No shortcuts.

20
00:01:09,887 --> 00:01:15,875
🎓 After completing the practice service, your sound lead gives you a verbal sign-off.

21
00:01:15,875 --> 00:01:19,700
Keep the Quick Reference Card at the console every Sunday.

22
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:23,075
When in doubt: mute the problem, then ask.

23
00:01:23,075 --> 00:01:34,962
